    "enUS": {
      "description": "I need a moment to rest before I find my own way out.\r\n\r\n<He pulls some reeds from his pack and quickly braids and bends them into a heart.>\r\n\r\nTake this, and bring it back to Caitlin. Let her know I'll be home soon! Now that we have a path cleared out thanks to you, I'll gather my bushels and follow your trail.\r\n\r\nThank you.",
      "dialogue": {
        "40264e7dd3439aad08fe": "I'm more than worried about him!"
      },
      "summary": "Return to Caitlin Grassman in Menethil Harbor.",
      "title": "Heartwoven",
